## Third-party components

Prism depends on third-party crates and npm packages that remain under their own
licenses. Their terms are listed in `Cargo.lock` / `package-lock.json` and in the
respective package metadata. `prism supply` can emit a CycloneDX SBOM of the
resolved dependency set.
